  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,0</mo></mrow></mfenced></math> lie on same side of line <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math> &hellip; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<i>&amp;</i>&nbsp;<math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> also lie on same side of <math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> &hellip; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br />From <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> &amp; <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> sum of all the integral values of <math><mi>&#8216;</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>&#8217;</mi></math> is <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>"
